<title>USA: Toyota May US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Toyota May US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp</p>
<p>			May 1-31, 1997     May 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    62,158	    66,637	     -6.7</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  14,321	    15,371	     -6.8</p>
<p> Import Car		19,309	    22,762	    -15.2</p>
<p> Import Truck	    24,933	    23,590	     +5.7</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-May 31, 1997 Jan 1-May 31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   275,800	   235,493	    +18.0</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  58,755	    58,598	     +1.1</p>
<p> Import Car		93,526	    96,340	     -2.2</p>
<p> Import Truck	   105,117	    88,358	    +19.9</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26, 128 for year to date vs 129 in year ago.</p>
</text>
